        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> WHAT THE HELL IS GOING ON?</P><P><BR>Valimar left because of 2 things that I can see. One, Valashino was harrassing Lling over her departure and Two, Valimar did not group in the guild. He had his own groupmates in higher areas than we as a guild could rightfully go. that is fine and great for him, I dont hold anything against him in the least.</P><P>Vulcane I dont have a clue as to why she left. She got tired of the monk, fine she started a Druid to continue to play. She was asking me about Jewelry and such. Then an hour later, I see he over guild saying that she is selling everythign on her at the first torch, WTF!!!</P><P>There is a problem here and its comunication. I am not the best at it, but I try. I cant tell you the number of people that I found out have left the guild because they have a new tag over their head or no tag at all. That is just plane hurtfull. I am very close to quiting because no one bothers to talk to me, so I wont be missed in the least.</P><P>How the hell can I fix if something if I dont know the details of how it is broken!?</P><P>Browso DaChoker</P><P>Maker of shiny trinkets<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
