        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I normally dont do posts, for a couple of reasons, the main is due to the fact that even though I have been part of the guild for about 6 months now I still felt somewhat like an outsider.  This is of no fault of the guild, part of it is my time to play is limited so I have rarely been able to join raids or group with guildmates, and because of this fact I myself have felt the need to leave the guild just because I was not able to make the friendships I was hoping too.</P><P>However (The reason for the post)I thought about my options and decided to wait for a while, let things take their course and see what happens.  Because of my level there were few people to group with, but recently I have grouped with Nerual and Gereth on more than one occasion and enjoyed my time with them.  I have also recieved help from Adyn for which I am greatful for, But the point of the story is that I wish you would reconsider your choice Kenton, let this mellow out some, let yourself reflect on what happened and please dont make a hasty decision based on a couple of incidents that happened when you were already frustrated.  I would hate to see you leave based on a choice made when angry and frustrated.</P><P><BR>Amarantha<BR>Level 34 Enchanter<BR>Little sister <img src=icon_smile.gif border=0 align=middle><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
