        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Unfortunately, the mechanics of the game we all play and love does not allow for easy communication to occur.  I think that this leads to more misunderstandings between people/guilds than we'll ever know.</P><P>Browso, the Lore Keepers have never been more stable than under your guidance.  Please don't think that you don't matter, because it's even obvious to me, an outsider, how much you mean and how much you do for your guild.</P><P>Kenton, you may have already made up your mind, but if you are the least bit hesitant then please reconsider.  The Lore Keepers have always been a great guild and I'd hate to see you regret a quick decision.  From the story that you related above, I don't think that you should be shouldering any blame for what has happened.</P><P>Have fun everyone!</P><P>-Glim</P><P>Glimlering Glimmerstone &lt;Nomadic Revellers&gt;<BR>Level 41 Gnome Enchantress<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
