        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> My friends, this is not a decision made in haste or anger.  I let that subside, long ago.  The only emotion I feel now is sadness. This sadness invades my RL.  I left the guild once due to a difference in opinion with some guild members over the way to handle a problem member.  One who had left, and was requesting re admittance. I can’t go into all my feeling back then.  I buried them, and adjusted my expectations and asked to come back. I was welcomed back. And I tried to do the right things.</P><P>Most of my LK friends have left.  Either the game or LK all together. </P><P>Daiyle<BR>Silverbeard<BR>Pogmo<BR>Berrick<BR>Hull<BR>Valimar (yes I felt he is a friend despite my momentary frustration)<BR>Spaul<BR>Lling<BR>…</P><P>The list is too long and I am too tired to keep going.</P><P>The list of folks who I did not know well and have left is even longer.</P><P>The list of folks who have indicated their indecision concerning LK is almost as long. </P><P>I will always be a servant of LK.  All one need to do is ask, and I will be there.</P><P>Your friend always,</P><P><BR>Kenton Cuttahotha<BR>Druid of the 45th Life Ring<BR>Do Not Meddle in the Affairs of Dragons... For you are Crunchy and Taste Good with Ketchup!!!<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
