        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Browso,</P><P>“Ditto What Lling (with a soft L) Said!”</P><P>My departure has nothing to do you or your leadership.  If anything it (your leadership) is the one thing that caused me to stay as long as I have.  I told a few of my friends I expected to do this a while ago.  It is not a result of endemic issues with LK.  It is the result of a feeling of dissatisfaction in general.  I honestly can’t put my finger on the real issue.  I know the comments last night in guild say pushed me over the edge. You have no idea how close I came to hitting the Delete button on the char screen.  I just don’t have the guts to do it.  I know I need a change.  I just don’t know what that change is.</P><P><BR>Kenton Cuttahotha<BR>Druid of the 45th Life Ring<BR>Do Not Meddle in the Affairs of Dragons... For you are Crunchy and Taste Good with Ketchup!!!<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
